stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NORMAL
    
    NORMAL --> ENTROPY_WARNING: lockup_imminent<br/>(time_to_lockup < 20ms)
    ENTROPY_WARNING --> NORMAL: entropy > threshold<br/>OR timer > 10ms
    ENTROPY_WARNING --> PRESSURE_REDUCTION: lockup_probability > 0.8<br/>OR entropy << threshold
    PRESSURE_REDUCTION --> PRESSURE_HOLD: timer > 20ms
    PRESSURE_HOLD --> PRESSURE_REAPPLY: slip < 20%<br/>AND stable
    PRESSURE_REAPPLY --> NORMAL: slip in 10-20%<br/>AND stable for 30ms
    
    NORMAL --> FAULT: sensor_failure<br/>OR CRC_error
    ENTROPY_WARNING --> FAULT: sensor_failure
    PRESSURE_REDUCTION --> FAULT: solenoid_failure
    FAULT --> NORMAL: diagnostic_pass<br/>AND manual_reset
    
    note right of NORMAL
        entry / Monitor system
        State: Normal operation
    end note
    
    note right of ENTROPY_WARNING
        entry / start_timer(10ms)
        Early alert state
    end note
    
    note right of PRESSURE_HOLD
        entry / hold_pressure()
        Maintain current pressure
    end note
    
    note right of PRESSURE_REDUCTION
        entry / dump_pressure()
        Emergency pressure dump
    end note
    
    note right of PRESSURE_REAPPLY
        entry / start_ramp(50%/s)
        Gradual pressure increase
    end note
    
    note right of FAULT
        System Error State
        Requires diagnostic pass & reset
    end note
